        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
        <div class="meta-date">Last updated: October 9, 2026 &bull; Compliant with GDPR and CCPA guidelines</div>

        <div class="notice-box">
            <strong>Key Commitment:</strong> We respect your privacy. Your uploaded resumes are only parsed to generate match analytics for your review. We never sell, auction, or share your resume text or personal details with advertisers or data brokers.
        </div>

        <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>When using Resume Rater, we collect minimal data essential to providing our algorithmic evaluation services:</p>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Document Data:</strong> Content extracted from resumes (PDF only) and job descriptions you submit for analysis.</li>
            <li><strong>Account &amp; History Data:</strong> Optional account email, name, and timestamp of evaluations stored securely via Supabase Auth and PostgreSQL.</li>
            <li><strong>No Payment Data:</strong> Resume Rater is 100% free. We never request, process, or store credit card, billing, or financial details.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <p>We process your data strictly to:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Parse and categorize CV sections (Summary, Experience, Skills, Education, Projects).</li>
            <li>Compute TF-IDF cosine similarity scores and keyword coverage radars against specified job requirements.</li>
            <li>Enable history tracking of candidate scores and radar charts across sessions.</li>
            <li>Respond to your technical questions and customer support inquiries.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>3. Temporary File Processing &amp; Data Retention</h2>
        <p>Uploaded PDF documents are temporarily processed in memory during the parsing phase and automatically cleaned up upon evaluation completion. Evaluation metrics and extracted text snippets are saved to your secure Supabase PostgreSQL instance.</p>

        <h2>4. Third-Party Service Providers</h2>
        <p>We work with trusted industry providers under strict data protection terms:</p>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Supabase:</strong> Cloud PostgreSQL database and single sign-on authentication service (Google, GitHub, Microsoft).</li>
            <li><strong>Infrastructure Hosting:</strong> Secured serverless environments with encrypted transit (HTTPS/TLS 1.3).</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>5. Your Rights (GDPR &amp; CCPA)</h2>
        <p>You have the right to request access to the data stored about you, request immediate deletion of your candidate records, or export your saved evaluations. To exercise any of these rights, simply email us at <a href="mailto:saadalioffic@gmail.com" style="color: var(--accent-primary); font-weight: 600;">saadalioffic@gmail.com</a>.</p>

        <h2>6. Security Measures</h2>
        <p>We implement strict security practices including input sanitization, PDF file magic-byte validation, rate-limiting on upload and billing APIs, and Content Security Policy headers preventing unauthorized script execution.</p>

        <h2>7. Contact Support</h2>
        <p>If you have questions regarding this Privacy Policy, please email us directly at <a href="mailto:saadalioffic@gmail.com" style="color: var(--accent-primary); font-weight: 600;">saadalioffic@gmail.com</a> or visit our <a href="/contact" style="color: var(--accent-primary); font-weight: 600;">Contact Us</a> page.</p>
    </main>

